#% title
# complex_vector_plot

#% text
# `complex_vector_plot(f, [z, z0, z1])` draws arrows of the field `(Re f, Im f)` over the rectangle with corners `z0` and `z1`.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Option `plot_points` sets the number of grid points (arrows) or seeds (streamlines) per side.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
complex_vector_plot(z^2, [z, -2 - 2*im, 2 + 2*im])
#% output
